recommend keep-going -- the zeroing census is the next lap and it is bounded: for each of the 47 vulnerable fixtures, signal it, diff against clean, and check whether its witness asserts on any line that changed. Gate at zero fixtures whose witness would not notice. Two runs each, well under an hour of machine time, and it measures exposure rather than population -- which generalizes past traps to any instrument that can publish a fabricated reading. The index-row writer is the other open loom, eight firings in and still hand-repaired.
